":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-29T16:34:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T08:09:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119878.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117202\r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14133\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an option to scale the UVs generated by `CSGPrimitive3D` nodes to match their size, avoiding the need to use triplanar UVs. I used the fixes for `CSGCylinder3D` and `CSGTorus3D` UVs from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117202 by @Jesusemora, branching from their PR.\r\n\r\n~~Unlike my [previous PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119696) I decided not to include `uv_offset` and `uv_scale` in this one. Mainly because each type would require a custom way of changing such options (`CSGCylinder3D` for example would have 4 `Vector2`s, for controlling offset and scale for the side faces and the cap faces separately), but also because controlling UVs per face together with a per face material override would be better in a future PR.~~\r\n\r\n- Implemented simple `uv_scale` and `uv_offset` as `Vector2`s that are applied equally to all faces.\r\n- Added `uv_match_size` property to `CSGPrimitive3D` for toggling UV scaling\r\n- `CSGMesh3D` is not affected by `uv_match_size`\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n|<img width=\"1247\" height=\"624\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b817680-f358-41ac-9e1b-30b00fcfee32\" />|<img width=\"1241\" height=\"621\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bffaadc6-59d4-4549-849f-a2523904adbf\" />|\r\n\r\n| Type | Demo |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `CSGBox3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"box\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50c3e828-928e-41ca-ba92-f4f5f36db033\" />|\r\n| `CSGSphere3D`, `CSGCylinder3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"cone_cylinder_sphere\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c249b24b-23e5-49d1-b477-a0d6edf84beb\" />|\r\n| `CSGTorus3D` |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"torus\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b16e5bf6-8d4f-4385-ac4a-adb675f5d70d\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (path)  |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_path\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2703da20-2d38-4141-ac05-3ccd1cf3b97d\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (spin)  |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_spin\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7f648ae-2868-4468-9c47-891490b53d9c\" />|\r\n| `CSGPolygon3D` (depth) |<img width=\"480\" height=\"252\" alt=\"polygon_depth\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25cedbd9-d67d-4f69-a159-9504396a1680\" />|  \r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119878/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":2,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119878/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}